// majula-289 (2005) `desc` by the same id. No check was made that ids are
// stable across that span (npc and loc ids are not all); where the two
// disagree, void-634's text is the one shown. A obj another file already
// defines has its desc in that file's section instead. Grade D: reference
// data, not checked against the live 2011 game text.
desc=The body of a Dwarf savaged by Goblins.

